bluejetty:00132879:android.description:
ANIMAL TRANSPORT TRUCK GAME CARIES YOU IN ANIMAL TRANSPORT GAMES ARENA by playing this Transport Animal Simulator you a transporter will complete multiple missions in animal games. Most drivers have to transport animals from the farm to the zoo driving the Farm Animal Transport Truck 3d in Animal Kingdom. 
Handling wild animals with care during truck transport delivery in this wild animal transport truck game is not easy due to their attacking attitude. Play and enjoy the Animal Cargo Truck Transporter and be humble during the transport of animals from one place to another in the animal revolt battle simulation. This Animal Game consists of multiple transport animals modes as in Animal Cargo which provides you with different environments of Animal Games in the gameplay as mentioned below.
DEER TRANSPORT MODE;
IN THIS MODE; TRANSPORT THE DEER WITH CAGE by Cargo Transport- Animal Truck to drop on the Farm as in animal simulation but definitely differ from other Wild Animals from Farm Animals. Drive your Cargo Transport - Animal Truck to get the elephants from the zoo animal park and take them to the farm outside the city animal shelter of Animals Truck Transport Simulator in Truck Wala Game.
In this animal simulator, you also have the opportunity to transport wild animals by Euro Truck in the animal games. As a driver of Animal Cargo Truck Transporter fulfill your duty to transport Farm Animals following instructions in all the modes using Animal Cargo Truck Game.
BUFFALOES TRANSPORT MODE;
BUFFALOES LOVE GREEN IN ZOO ANIMAL GAMES and they like grass to eat so transport them by Euro Truck in this Animal Simulation to Fairy meadows of animal cargo- truck games. Cows have eaten much grass in the meadow and they are full now in the animal game, It’s Time for milking, take them to Farm by Animal Truck for the milking process in animal game.
CAREER MODE;
A FARMER BOUGHT TWO FULL BLACK BULLS USING ANIMAL CARGO TRUCK for its Animal Farm Simulator of Animal Kingdom. Go and Transport animals to his Own Farm by Animal Truck Driving simulation 3d. There is an animal disease spreading in animal games, two zebras are affected in Zoo 2 Animal Park, use your Best Truck Transport for rescue animal games and take them to Hospital immediately in Transport Animal Games. Elephants escaped from the animal zoo park game as in Animal Truck Game Transport 3d; Police C

